  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aral Sea UN Human Security Trust Fund for the Aral Sea in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Multi-Partner Human Security Trust Fund for the Aral Sea Region in Uzbekistan (MPHSTF) uses a multi-sector approach to build the resilience of communities affected by the current ecological disaster. This is done through the application of timely and coordinated environmental, economic, food, health, and social solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
